{
  "info": {
    "name": "storyboard - motor-local (ADH-OS-20260905-01) - Etapa 4 [extensao]",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Coleção gerada a partir da SEÇÃO 5 (Contratos públicos) do FDD\n`docs/domains/storyboard/features/motor-local-fdd.md`\n\nFeature 'motor-local': geração local de keyframes (Flux) e inpaint real por máscara via ComfyUI headless, como opção ADICIONAL ao caminho pago Higgsfield.\n\nBase das rotas: /api/projects/{pid}/storyboard/local. Requer {{pid}} de um projeto existente e o serviço FastAPI no ar (PORT=8766). O motor local (binário `engine` + ComfyUI) é externo: com ele offline, generate/inpaint retornam 409 (gate), não 5xx.\n\nNÃO sobrescreve a coleção `storyboard.postman_collection.json` (OS-004)."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "pid",
      "value": "",
      "description": "id de um projeto existente (path param {pid})"
    },
    {
      "key": "pidInexistente",
      "value": "projeto-que-nao-existe",
      "description": "para o caso 404"
    },
    {
      "key": "sourceId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "id de candidato-fonte para /inpaint (opcional)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 status (saude do motor)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET status (saude do motor local)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{pid}}/storyboard/local/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "projects",
                "{{pid}}",
                "storyboard",
                "local",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "FDD motor-local sec.5 (L68-69). Motor offline e ready:false com detail, nunca 5xx."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status -> 200 (nunca 5xx)\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"expoe ready/detail/models\", function () {",
                  "    var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"ready\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"detail\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"models\");",
                  "});",
                  "// FDD sec.5 L68-69: {engine_installed, comfy_up, ready, detail, models:[{id,label,default}]}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 generate — keyframes locais (F1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST generate (keyframes locais, job 202)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{pid}}/storyboard/local/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "projects",
                "{{pid}}",
                "storyboard",
                "local",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "FDD motor-local sec.5 (L71-74) e Fluxo F1 (L36-42). Body: {prompt:str, count:int=4, model:str='flux-schnell', steps?:int, seed?:int}. steps/seed sao opcionais no FDD — nao enviados por default. 200 = job aberto (start-de-job, convencao do studio); 409 se motor offline ou job em andamento (pasta erros).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"a cinematic wide shot of a neon city at night\",\n  \"count\": 4,\n  \"model\": \"flux-schnell\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"generate -> 200 (job aberto)\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "// Se o motor estiver offline, o FDD (sec.5 L73) manda 409 (gate). Ver pasta erros.",
                  "pm.test(\"corpo tem forma de job\", function () {",
                  "    var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"state\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"mode\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
